  "ai_language_tip": "Speak Sinhala (si) in most of the country and Tamil (ta) in the North, East and Tamil-run businesses; English is widely understood in Colombo businesses, hotels and private hospitals.",
  "english_ok": "yes — Common in Colombo businesses, hotels, private hospitals and offices; limited at small village shops and in some regions.",
  "politeness": "Polite and gentle: greet with ayubowan (Sinhala) or vanakkam (Tamil); use sir/madam or mahattaya/nona; thank with stuti (Sinhala) or nandri (Tamil).",
  "name_tip": "Sinhala names often have long ancestral/family names; people are addressed as Mr/Mrs + surname or by given name; Tamil names often use the father's initial; book under the name given + mobile.",
  "phone_tip": "Mobile 10 digits starting 07 (07X 123 4567); Colombo landline 011 123 4567; read back in 3-3-4 groups; WhatsApp is usually the same mobile.",
  "time_tip": "12-hour with AM/PM or morning/evening words; CRITICAL: Sinhala 'hatha hamarayi' (හත හමාරයි) = 7:30, but a '-ta' (to) ending means quarter to: 'atata kaalayi' (අටට කාලයි) = 7:45, not 8:15; confirm morning or evening.",
  "number_tip": "Read phone digits singly in English or Sinhala; prices in rupees (Rs); dates day/month.",
  "avoid_calling": "Avoid lunch 12:30–13:30, calls after 20:00, Poya (full-moon) days when many businesses close or slow down, and Sinhala and Tamil New Year (mid-April).",
  "closed_days": "Office weekend is Sat–Sun; every Poya day is a public holiday with liquor shops and bars closed; Sinhala and Tamil New Year closes many businesses for days.",
  "booking_channels": "WhatsApp is the main chat channel, Viber second; eChannelling, doc.lk and hospital apps for doctors; Uber Eats and PickMe Food for delivery; PickMe and Uber for rides; phone calls still common.",
  "voice_menu": "Telcos (Dialog, SLT-Mobitel, Airtel/Hutch), banks and eChannelling use Sinhala/Tamil/English IVR; small businesses answer directly.",
  "callback_habits": "Businesses confirm on WhatsApp or by call-back; eChannelling sends SMS with an appointment number; couriers call on delivery.",
